  "description": "<p>⭐ <em>Give the gift of celestial wonder with <strong>Smithsonian Starstruck: An Immersive Experience</strong> is a transformative gift card that invites someone special to traverse the cosmos</em></p>\n\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n✨ A unique gift that unlocks cosmic wonder for any curious explorer<br>\n🚀 Immersive VR journey that brushes the edges of galaxies and stars<br>\n🌌 Thoughtful, science-forward surprise that sparks imagination and awe in recipients everywhere<br>\n🎁 Perfect for celebrations, anniversaries, or simply brightening someone’s day</p>\n\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Duration: approx. 1 hour (including a 40-minute VR experience)<br>\n📍 Location: Science Museum, Exhibition Rd, South Kensington, London SW7 2DD<br>\n👤 Age requirement: 10+<br>\n♿ Accessibility: We are committed to ensuring all visitors can enjoy the experience<br>\n❓ Please consult our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://smithsonianstarstruck.com/london/#faqs\" target=\"_blank\"><u>FAQ page</u></a></p>\n\n<p><strong>Gift Card Info</strong><br>\n📨 How it works: you will receive a unique code that you can send to the recipient of your gift card - they can then redeem the code for a ticket in the Fever app<br>\n🔑 Validity: the gift card can be used for <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.feverup.com/m/662678\">Smithsonian Starstruck: An Immersive Experience</a> on any available date<br>\n📱 Please see your confirmation email for all essential information</p>\n\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nAn immersive, fully interactive journey designed as a thoughtful gift<br>\nInvite the recipient to step into the cosmos without leaving the room<br>\nA vivid VR experience that blends real science with cinematic storytelling<br>\nDeveloped with the Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory to bring space closer<br>\nEach moment sparks curiosity, wonder, and a personal sense of awe<br>\nThe gift card opens the door to exploration, imagination, and discovery<br>\nIdeal for curious minds, families, and dreamers who treasure wonder</p>",
